{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/934582-question-about-dracula-and-longinus-in-requiem-2e","id":934582,"title":"Question about Dracula and Longinus in Requiem 2e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-20T10:36:36-07:00","id":934582,"title":"Question about Dracula and Longinus in Requiem 2e","content":"I have recently been told that in Requiem 2e, Dracula was not cursed by God to become a vampire, but rather was created as a &quot;normal&quot; revenant. Is this accurate? If so, what about Longinus, who in Requiem 1e was also cursed by God with vampirism for stabbing Jesus in the side with a spear (as well as for being a particularly evil person his entire life). Is Longinus also no longer cursed? Just wondering. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T11:04:19-07:00","id":934601,"title":"","content":"Dracula is said to have been a vampire without sire, &quot;the most famous of all Revenants&quot;, although the write-up mentions in relation to his spontaneous embrace that he cursed his assassins and cursed God, and the latter heard him. Longinus is still said to have been cursed by the blood of Christ, becoming unique among vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T11:06:14-07:00","id":934604,"title":"","content":"The Lancea et Sanctum 'beleive' that he was cursed by God, but it is not proven one way or the other.<br /> <br /> Even so, the exact nature of his rising is not detailed (in 2e at least). Just that after he became a vampire he believed that he was made such as God's will, not even specifically that it happened spontaneously or anything. He could have been Embraced as normal, and that could still be God's doing by working through and agent as God tends to do in the stories.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T12:05:22-07:00","id":934637,"title":"","content":"Thank you. That helps a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T14:23:56-07:00","id":934704,"title":"","content":"I think with both, if its actually relevant to your game, you can have them cursed with undeath by God/God-Machine/fiat, revenants that didn't require uplifting, revenants that <i>did, </i>vampires that never knew their sires (post-mortem Embrace fits well with Dracula's origin) or whose sires have been wiped from history as they were mythologised.<br /> <br /> As with much of the NWoD, it's an open-ended question for you to answer, or not, as you see fit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 07-20-2016, 05:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T10:29:11-07:00","id":935123,"title":"","content":"Dracula and Longinus are still widely believed to have been cursed by God, and as the developer, I think there's a very good chance that's true. However, they're no longer the only vampires to rise without a deliberate Embrace.<br /> <br /> Most vampires don't understand the Embrace as well as we players do. They've got layers of cultural baggage, a socially-encouraged tendency to talk about it in whispers, and it doesn't always go according to plan. They're also aware of spontaneous risings, and have heard rumors of mortals being Embraced by the Dragons' surgery and other unusual means.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T15:21:43-07:00","id":936747,"title":"","content":"I think that there is some info on Dracula and his Curse in Dark Eras","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1191-rosencroft","name":"Rosencroft","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T01:04:54-07:00","id":937989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rosencroft</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/934582-question-about-dracula-and-longinus-in-requiem-2e?p=936747#post936747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that there is some info on Dracula and his Curse in Dark Eras</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. In the Constantinople chapter Vlad The Impaler's war against the Ottomans is partially motivated by his knowledge that they are under the sway of the God-Machine. Vlad doesn't explicitly understand what the God-Machine is, he just knows that some compelling force is manipulating his destiny and he is driven to stop it.<br /> <br /> It's not stated what his clan or who his sire (if any) was. Just that upon his defeat he emerges from beneath the bodies of the battlefield, thirsty for blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}